Implement a modular email provider framework.

Suggested directory structure:

```text
src/
  email/
    connectors/
      EmailConnector.ts
      GmailConnector.ts
      Microsoft365Connector.ts
      ImapSmtpConnector.ts
      ConnectorRegistry.ts
      ConnectorFactory.ts
    services/
      MailboxConnectionService.ts
      OAuthService.ts
      EmailSyncService.ts
      EmailDispatchService.ts
